
-- The prior REVOKE FROM anon had no effect on functions with PUBLIC EXECUTE grants
-- (anon inherits from PUBLIC). Fix: REVOKE FROM PUBLIC, then re-grant to authenticated.
-- Functions kept for anon (public flows): verify_certificate, check_password_reuse(text),
-- complete_password_reset, record_failed_login_attempt, lock_account,
-- clear_failed_login_attempts, log_security_audit_event_v2.

